Linda Lael Millertakes a vintage dress-shop owner on a breathtaking adventure in medieval England--where a bewitching love awaits...
Diana Baneunlocks the secret love behind Maggie's taunting dreams of a clan war from centuries past...
Anna Jennettakes a plunge into the sea from the cliffs of Cornwall--and falls back in time, into the arms of a heroic knight...
